Package: PlateReaderExperiment
Type: Package
Title: Structured Plate Reader Experiments
Version: 0.1.8
Authors@R: person("Moritz", "Lindner", email = "moritz@lindnerlab.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Defines an S4 representation for plate-reader experiments with
    canonical sample by channel by time by position assay arrays. Includes
    importers for Tecan SparkControl Excel exports, experimental-design
    annotation, merging of compatible experiments, aggregation, control subtraction,
    channel ratios, long-format conversion, and
    plotting helpers.
